`reg 28(5) — the employments excluded under (2)(d), taken together, are pensionable employment` kind `the total period in hours of those employments with the same employer in the year` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `employment by the Government of Canada, the government of a province, a municipality or a school board in connection with a referendum or election to public office` THEN `the total period in hours of those employments with the same employer in the year` GREATER THAN 34
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 28 (1) Subject to subsections (3) to (5), employment in which persons are ordinarily employed to an
-- inconsiderable extent is excepted from pensionable employment.
-- src:340 | 28 (1) Subject to subsections (3) to (5), employment in which persons are ordinarily employed to an inconsiderable extent is excepted from pensionable employment.
